    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "lbv37on",
      "content": "Telangana is located in south-central India on the Deccan Plateau. Its geographical coordinates are approximately 15°46'N to 19°54'N latitude and 77°16'E to 81°43'E longitude."
