      "level": 3,
      "content": "2.2.1 Major Rivers"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "o0a5yja",
      "content": "Telangana is a land of rivers. Two of India's major rivers – the Godavari and the Krishna – flow through the state, making it an agricultural powerhouse."
    },
