      "items": [
        "Godavari River enters Telangana at Kandakurthi in Nizamabad district.",
        "Krishna River enters Telangana at Gudeballur in Narayanpet district.",
        "Amrabad Tiger Reserve is situated in the Nallamala hill range across Nagarkurnool and Nalgonda districts.",
        "The Kaleshwaram Lift Irrigation Project is constructed on the Godavari River."
      ],
      "id": "0i20yih"
